{"type":"message","id":"770612e4","parentId":"9c6bfb5e","timestamp":"2026-03-12T19:13:00.634Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:f6b9edc7-5375-4a0a-b88b-3989ad8ab3eb skill-evolution-hourly] 执行自动进化任务：1. 搜索 ClawHub 上最新的高效技能（搜索关键词：calendar, task, document, meeting, email, notes, productivity, automation）；2. 筛选下载量>100且6个月内更新的技能；3. 安装有价值的技能；4. 生成简短报告记录到 memory/evolution-YYYY-MM-DD.md\nCurrent time: Friday, March 13th, 2026 — 3:13 AM (Asia/Shanghai)\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1773342780633}}
{"type":"message","id":"2a04383d","parentId":"770612e4","timestamp":"2026-03-12T19:13:09.843Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户发送了一个 cron 任务，要求我执行自动进化任务：\n1. 搜索 ClawHub 上最新的高效技能（特定关键词）\n2. 筛选下载量>100且6个月内更新的技能\n3. 安装有价值的技能\n4. 生成简短报告记录到 memory/evolution-YYYY-MM-DD.md\n\n当前时间是 2026年3月13日（星期五）凌晨3:13。\n\n首先，我需要使用 ClawHub CLI 来搜索技能。让我先检查是否有 clawhub 技能可用。\n\n看技能列表，有：\n- clawhub: 使用 ClawHub CLI 搜索、安装、更新和发布技能\n\n我应该先读取 clawhub 技能的 SKILL.md 文件来了解如何使用它。\n\n但根据描述，这个技能就是为了从 clawhub.com 搜索、安装技能的。让我先执行搜索。\n\n关键词：calendar, task, document, meeting, email, notes, productivity, automation\n\n我需要用 clawhub CLI 来搜索这些技能。让我先检查 clawhub 命令是否可用。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"我来执行技能进化任务。首先检查 ClawHub CLI 并搜索相关技能。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_f6d9044d446f4a21b365b53d","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/opt/homebrew/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/clawhub/SKILL.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_09b747964f6540da875ac68b","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub --help"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":12705,"output":276,"cacheRead":2752,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15733,"cost":{"input":0.012705,"output":0.0008832000000000001,"cacheRead":0.0005504,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0141386}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773342780634}}
{"type":"message","id":"068b47e7","parentId":"2a04383d","timestamp":"2026-03-12T19:13:09.851Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_f6d9044d446f4a21b365b53d","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: clawhub\ndescription: Use the ClawHub CLI to search, install, update, and publish agent skills from clawhub.com. Use when you need to fetch new skills on the fly, sync installed skills to latest or a specific version, or publish new/updated skill folders with the npm-installed clawhub CLI.\nmetadata:\n  {\n    \"openclaw\":\n      {\n        \"requires\": { \"bins\": [\"clawhub\"] },\n        \"install\":\n          [\n            {\n              \"id\": \"node\",\n              \"kind\": \"node\",\n              \"package\": \"clawhub\",\n              \"bins\": [\"clawhub\"],\n              \"label\": \"Install ClawHub CLI (npm)\",\n            },\n          ],\n      },\n  }\n---\n\n# ClawHub CLI\n\nInstall\n\n```bash\nnpm i -g clawhub\n```\n\nAuth (publish)\n\n```bash\nclawhub login\nclawhub whoami\n```\n\nSearch\n\n```bash\nclawhub search \"postgres backups\"\n```\n\nInstall\n\n```bash\nclawhub install my-skill\nclawhub install my-skill --version 1.2.3\n```\n\nUpdate (hash-based match + upgrade)\n\n```bash\nclawhub update my-skill\nclawhub update my-skill --version 1.2.3\nclawhub update --all\nclawhub update my-skill --force\nclawhub update --all --no-input --force\n```\n\nList\n\n```bash\nclawhub list\n```\n\nPublish\n\n```bash\nclawhub publish ./my-skill --slug my-skill --name \"My Skill\" --version 1.2.0 --changelog \"Fixes + docs\"\n```\n\nNotes\n\n- Default registry: https://clawhub.com (override with CLAWHUB_REGISTRY or --registry)\n- Default workdir: cwd (falls back to OpenClaw workspace); install dir: ./skills (override with --workdir / --dir / CLAWHUB_WORKDIR)\n- Update command hashes local files, resolves matching version, and upgrades to latest unless --version is set\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773342789850}}
{"type":"message","id":"81a60780","parentId":"068b47e7","timestamp":"2026-03-12T19:13:10.106Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_09b747964f6540da875ac68b","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Usage: clawhub [options] [command]\n\nClawHub CLI v0.7.0\ninstall, update, search, and publish agent skills.\n\nOptions:\n  -V, --cli-version                       Show CLI version\n  --workdir <dir>                         Working directory (default: cwd)\n  --dir <dir>                             Skills directory (relative to workdir, default: skills)\n  --site <url>                            Site base URL (for browser login)\n  --registry <url>                        Registry API base URL\n  --no-input                              Disable prompts\n  -h, --help                              display help for command\n\nCommands:\n  login [options]                         Log in (opens browser or stores token)\n  logout                                  Remove stored token\n  whoami                                  Validate token\n  auth                                    Authentication commands\n  search [options] <query...>             Vector search skills\n  install [options] <slug>                Install into <dir>/<slug>\n  update [options] [slug]                 Update installed skills\n  uninstall [options] <slug>              Uninstall a skill\n  list                                    List installed skills (from lockfile)\n  explore [options]                       Browse latest updated skills from the registry\n  inspect [options] <slug>                Fetch skill metadata and files without installing\n  publish [options] <path>                Publish skill from folder\n  delete [options] <slug>                 Soft-delete a skill (moderator/admin only)\n  hide [options] <slug>                   Hide a skill (moderator/admin only)\n  undelete [options] <slug>               Restore a hidden skill (moderator/admin only)\n  unhide [options] <slug>                 Unhide a skill (moderator/admin only)\n  ban-user [options] <handleOrId>         Ban a user and delete owned skills (moderator/admin only)\n  set-role [options] <handleOrId> <role>  Change a user role (admin only)\n  star [options] <slug>                   Add a skill to your highlights\n  unstar [options] <slug>                 Remove a skill from your highlights\n  sync [options]                          Scan local skills and publish new/updated ones\n\nEnv:\n  CLAWHUB_SITE\n  CLAWHUB_REGISTRY\n  CLAWHUB_WORKDIR\n  (CLAWDHUB_* supported)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":253,"aggregated":"Usage: clawhub [options] [command]\n\nClawHub CLI v0.7.0\ninstall, update, search, and publish agent skills.\n\nOptions:\n  -V, --cli-version                       Show CLI version\n  --workdir <dir>                         Working directory (default: cwd)\n  --dir <dir>                             Skills directory (relative to workdir, default: skills)\n  --site <url>                            Site base URL (for browser login)\n  --registry <url>                        Registry API base URL\n  --no-input                              Disable prompts\n  -h, --help                              display help for command\n\nCommands:\n  login [options]                         Log in (opens browser or stores token)\n  logout                                  Remove stored token\n  whoami                                  Validate token\n  auth                                    Authentication commands\n  search [options] <query...>             Vector search skills\n  install [options] <slug>                Install into <dir>/<slug>\n  update [options] [slug]                 Update installed skills\n  uninstall [options] <slug>              Uninstall a skill\n  list                                    List installed skills (from lockfile)\n  explore [options]                       Browse latest updated skills from the registry\n  inspect [options] <slug>                Fetch skill metadata and files without installing\n  publish [options] <path>                Publish skill from folder\n  delete [options] <slug>                 Soft-delete a skill (moderator/admin only)\n  hide [options] <slug>                   Hide a skill (moderator/admin only)\n  undelete [options] <slug>               Restore a hidden skill (moderator/admin only)\n  unhide [options] <slug>                 Unhide a skill (moderator/admin only)\n  ban-user [options] <handleOrId>         Ban a user and delete owned skills (moderator/admin only)\n  set-role [options] <handleOrId> <role>  Change a user role (admin only)\n  star [options] <slug>                   Add a skill to your highlights\n  unstar [options] <slug>                 Remove a skill from your highlights\n  sync [options]                          Scan local skills and publish new/updated ones\n\nEnv:\n  CLAWHUB_SITE\n  CLAWHUB_REGISTRY\n  CLAWHUB_WORKDIR\n  (CLAWDHUB_* supported)","cwd":"/Users/ciss-ai/.openclaw/agents/zongzhu"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1773342790105}}
