{"type":"message","id":"1a6d578f","parentId":"376b89d2","timestamp":"2026-03-12T19:14:26.358Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，现在我有了技能的详细信息。我注意到 `inspect` 命令没有返回下载量信息。让我尝试 `clawhub explore` 命令来获取更多信息，或者直接基于相关性、更新时间来筛选。\n\n从获取的信息来看，符合条件（6个月内更新）的技能：\n1. **calendar** - 2026-02-26更新，较新\n2. **email-daily-summary** - 2026-03-11更新，非常新\n3. **automation-workflows** - 2026-02-26更新\n4. **productivity** - 2026-03-11更新，非常新，版本1.0.4\n5. **task** - 2026-03-12更新，非常新\n\n由于没有明确的下载量信息，我会基于搜索评分和相关度来判断价值。\n\n让我也检查一下其他几个可能的高价值技能，特别是那些搜索评分高的。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"检查更多高价值技能："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_081baa0cddd044c28e14ddfa","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub explore --json 2>/dev/null | head -100 || clawhub explore 2>/dev/null | head -50"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_4cdcf4f1915140048d296663","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub inspect gcalcli-calendar 2>/dev/null"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_716b59612587449ca3044ecc","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub inspect document-pro 2>/dev/null"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_1992d24e1e034840b67a64dd","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub inspect meeting-prep 2>/dev/null"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":1022,"output":301,"cacheRead":18176,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19499,"cost":{"input":0.001022,"output":0.0009632000000000001,"cacheRead":0.0036352000000000003,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0056204}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773342853713}}
{"type":"message","id":"39ee40b7","parentId":"1a6d578f","timestamp":"2026-03-12T19:14:28.889Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_081baa0cddd044c28e14ddfa","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"agent-guard\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Agent Guard\",\n      \"summary\": \"Real-time prompt injection and command injection detection for OpenClaw agents. Screens incoming messages, tool results, GitHub issues, and external content...\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 0,\n        \"downloads\": 0,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 0,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 0,\n        \"stars\": 0,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1773342770214,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773342800082,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1773342770214,\n        \"changelog\": \"Initial release of AgentGuard – a security middleware for real-time prompt and command injection detection for OpenClaw agents.\\n\\n- Screens all incoming messages, tool results, GitHub issues, and external content for known malicious patterns before agent processing.\\n- Detects multiple threat categories: command injection, prompt injection (multi-language), social engineering, filesystem/network manipulation, encoding/obfuscation, and rendering exploits.\\n- Provides an automatic screening protocol applied to every interaction; blocks or warns based on detected threat level.\\n- Offers manual commands for users to scan text, GitHub issues, and check protection status.\\n- Includes configurable sensitivity contexts for trusted developer workflows or high-risk environments.\\n- Detailed documentation on usage, threat categories, limitations, and troubleshooting included.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"binance-coach\",\n      \"displayName\": \"BinanceCoach\",\n      \"summary\": \"AI-powered crypto trading behavior coach for Binance users. Analyzes live portfolio health, detects emotional trading patterns (FOMO, panic selling, overtrad...\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"binance\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"coaching\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"crypto\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"dca\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"latest\": \"1.3.5\",\n        \"trading\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 0,\n        \"downloads\": 210,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 2,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 2,\n        \"stars\": 1,\n        \"versions\": 27\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1773141757761,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773342780317,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.3.5\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1773342736394,\n        \"changelog\": \"fix: address security scanner flags — upfront setup disclosure, USER.md hook defaults to N, non-interactive mode skips USER.md entirely, update command shows what it fetches, removed inaccurate no-internet claim from README\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"raiffeisen-elba\",\n      \"displayName\": \"raiffeisen-elba\",\n      \"summary\": \"Automate Raiffeisen ELBA online banking: login/logout, list accounts, and fetch transactions via Playwright.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.4.1\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 0,\n        \"downloads\": 812,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 2,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 2,\n        \"stars\": 0,\n        \"versions\": 11\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1770886786038,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773342771700,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.4.1\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1773342743153,\n        \"changelog\": \"- Added a security disclaimer to documentation, clarifying no passwords are stored and outlining the use of 2FA flow.\\n- New README.md file intr