{"type":"message","id":"63f74605","parentId":"16d91457","timestamp":"2026-03-12T19:15:41.888Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"遇到了 rate limit。让我稍等一下，然后记录当前状态并生成报告。\n\n目前已安装的技能列表很丰富，包括：\n- productivity, task, calendar（已安装）\n- document-pro, document-summary（文档处理）\n- ai-meeting-notes, meeting-prep, meeting-to-action, coordinate-meeting（会议相关）\n- email-best-practices, email-to-calendar（邮件相关）\n- apple-notes, bear-notes, obsidian, flomo-notes（笔记相关）\n- automation-workflows（自动化）\n- 等等\n\n让我生成进化报告。由于当前时间是 2026年3月13日，我需要写入 memory/evolution-2026-03-13.md。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"遇到 rate limit，稍后重试更新。现在生成进化报告："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_c7ec13f67c2d4789b3c3b68c","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/Users/ciss-ai/.openclaw/agents/zongzhu/memory/evolution-2026-03-13.md","content":"# 技能进化报告 - 2026-03-13\n\n## 执行时间\n2026年3月13日 03:13 (Asia/Shanghai)\n\n## 搜索关键词\ncalendar, task, document, meeting, email, notes, productivity, automation\n\n## 发现的高价值技能\n\n### 已安装并可用 ✅\n\n| 技能 | 搜索评分 | 更新时间 | 说明 |\n|------|---------|---------|------|\n| productivity | 3.561 | 2026-03-11 | 生产力管理、时间块、目标规划 |\n| task | 3.629 | 2026-03-12 | 任务管理，支持今天/过期/周规划 |\n| calendar | 3.702 | 2026-02-26 | 日程管理，跨平台同步 |\n| document-pro | 3.490 | 2026-02-26 | PDF/DOCX/PPT文档解析提取 |\n| ai-meeting-notes | 3.495 | 近期更新 | AI会议笔记+待办跟踪 |\n| automation-workflows | 3.744 | 2026-02-26 | 自动化工作流设计 |\n\n### 其他发现\n- **gcalcli-calendar** (3.655): Google Calendar专用，token高效\n- **email-daily-summary** (3.581): 邮件摘要生成，支持Gmail/Outlook/QQ邮箱\n- **meeting-prep** (3.490): 会议准备+GitHub提交摘要\n\n## 当前已安装技能 (45个)\n\n### 生产力核心\n- productivity, task, calendar, schedule\n- ai-meeting-notes, meeting-prep, meeting-to-action, coordinate-meeting\n- document-pro, document-summary\n\n### 笔记系统\n- apple-notes, bear-notes, obsidian, flomo-notes\n\n### 日历/邮件\n- gcalcli-calendar, macos-calendar, lark-calendar\n- email-best-practices, email-to-calendar\n\n### 自动化\n- automation-workflows, proactive-agent\n\n### 工具\n- trello, todoist, things-mac, outlook\n- brave-search, multi-search-engine\n- self-improving-agent, openclaw-optimizer\n\n## 操作记录\n1. ✅ 搜索8个关键词，获取~80个相关技能\n2. ✅ 使用 `clawhub inspect` 检查高价值技能详情\n3. ⏸️ 安装/更新遇到 rate limit（已安装技能足够丰富）\n4. ✅ 已有45个技能覆盖所有核心场景\n\n## 结论\n当前技能库已足够完善，覆盖方总日常事务的各个方面：\n- 📅 日程管理: calendar + gcalcli-calendar + macos-calendar\n- ✅ 任务跟踪: task + todoist + things-mac\n- 📝 文档处理: document-pro + document-summary\n- 🤝 会议效率: ai-meeting-notes + meeting-prep\n- 📧 邮件管理: email-best-practices + email-to-calendar\n- ⚡ 自动化: automation-workflows + proactive-agent\n\n## 建议\n- 下次 rate limit 重置后运行 `clawhub update --all` 同步最新版本\n- 持续关注 meeting-autopilot-pro 等新兴技能\n\n---\n*自动进化任务执行完毕*\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":687,"output":915,"cacheRead":21568,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23170,"cost":{"input":0.000687,"output":0.002928,"cacheRead":0.004313600000000001,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.007928600000000001}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773342914530}}
